# GludioWizardUseSkill (35061, a wizard mercenary) sees the character, who neither defends
# nor owns its castle: on a draw of 1 of 10000 it shouts NpcString 1800013, and it wants to
# attack the character with weight 200 (a desire, not rendered). Its template lists no DD
# magic, so it wants no cast. Its other hooks only queue cast desires, which the format
# cannot check (#3983): tests/ai/siege_guard_wizard_test.go covers them.
character Hunter 20
random always 1
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioWizard.GludioWizard
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioWizard.GludioWizardUseSkill
npc wizard 35061 SiegeGuard 600 0 0

approach wizard
  S NpcSay obj=wizard type=1 npc=1035061 text="Death to those who challenge the Lord!"
